{"task_id": "0bb8813a21dc", "source": "bank:1cd6e373f225", "bank": "1cd6e373f225", "original_id": "easy_p06", "title": "Row Leader Recolor", "difficulty": "easy", "skills": ["row-control", "recolor", "same_size"], "written_solution": "In each row, the leftmost nonzero cell chooses the row\u2019s leader color; recolor every nonzero cell in that row to that leader.", "train": [{"input": [[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [3, 0, 5, 0, 7, 0], [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [2, 4, 0, 6, 0, 8], [0, 9, 0, 9, 9, 0]], "output": [[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3, 0, 3, 0], [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [2, 2, 0, 2, 0, 2], [0, 9, 0, 9, 9, 0]]}, {"input": [[4, 0, 2, 2, 0, 0, 7], [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [6, 0, 0, 3, 0, 3, 0], [0, 5, 5, 0, 1, 0, 1]], "output": [[4, 0, 4, 4, 0, 0, 4], [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [6, 0, 0, 6, 0, 6, 0], [0, 5, 5, 0, 5, 0, 5]]}, {"input": [[0, 8, 0, 4, 0, 4], [9, 0, 7, 0, 7, 7], [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [3, 1, 1, 0, 2, 0]], "output": [[0, 8, 0, 8, 0, 8], [9, 0, 9, 0, 9, 9], [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [3, 3, 3, 0, 3, 0]]}], "test": [{"input": [[5, 0, 1, 1, 0, 7, 0], [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [2, 3, 0, 4, 4, 0, 9], [0, 6, 0, 6, 0, 8, 8]], "output": [[5, 0, 5, 5, 0, 5, 0], [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [2, 2, 0, 2, 2, 0, 2], [0, 6, 0, 6, 0, 6, 6]]}], "program_solution": "(rule!\n ;; Every non-zero cell takes its ROW's first non-zero color.\n (grid-from-fn h w (lambda (r c)\n   (let ((nz (filter (lambda (cc) (!= (at g r cc) 0)) (range 0 w))))\n     (if (and (not (empty? nz)) (!= (at g r c) 0)) (at g r (first nz)) 0)))))", "solution_language": "racket", "needs_conversion": false, "content_hash": "0bb8813a21dc", "slug": "row_leader_recolor", "parent_hash": null, "parent_reason": null}
